Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.96,0:00:13.98,Default,Ilia,0,0,0,,The princess has returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.93,0:00:17.52,Default,Ilia,0,0,0,,She's in the courtyard with Lady Euphyllia.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.80,0:00:33.11,Default,Sylphine,0,0,0,,Anis!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.09,0:00:50.01,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I don't want to let you become queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.01,0:00:53.11,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I don't want to let you give up everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.78,0:00:57.25,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.62,0:01:01.21,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Let's settle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.99,0:01:04.96,Title,Title,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\fad(2025,1)\pos(320,3)\blur2}The Magical Revolution
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.99,0:01:04.96,Title,Title,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\fad(2025,1)\pos(320,3)\blur2\clip(m 116 -4 l 113 41 331 42 328 13 310 41 116 39 120 -3 238 1 218 27 192 -11 357 -3 332 26 331 -12 535 -12 525 38 473 38 492 8)}The {\c&H7A4AE4&}Mag{\c&HE38B59&}ical {\c&H7A4AE4&}Revol{\c&HE38B59&}ution
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.99,0:01:04.96,Title,Title,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\fad(2025,1)\fs15\pos(320,39)\blur2}of the {\c&H7A4AE4&}Reincarnated Princess {\c&H140900&}and the {\c&HE38B59&}Genius Young Lady
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.44,0:01:37.57,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,You deserve to be rewarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.53,0:01:41.71,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I mean, you've been through so much pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.71,0:01:45.71,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,You could have freedom from now on \Nand live the way you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.46,0:01:51.26,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,So there's no need for you to take my place!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.68,0:01:53.64,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Yes, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.16,0:01:56.30,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,There is no replacement for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.73,0:01:59.39,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Who could ever hope to take your place?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.54,0:02:05.19,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Miss Anis, I believe in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.73,0:02:13.14,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Your dream, your magic, \Ncan fly so much higher and farther.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.99,0:02:16.51,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Your day is yet to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.51,0:02:19.95,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,When it does, I want to live it with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.95,0:02:24.15,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I don't want to sacrifice you \Nto make my dream come true!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.55,0:02:27.12,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,You don't have to go through that for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.34,0:02:28.95,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I'm oka—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.95,0:02:30.93,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.93,0:02:35.48,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,You're crying right now \Nbecause you're not okay at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.19,0:02:41.06,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,As long as no one's getting hurt, who cares?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.06,0:02:45.90,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,If I give up and just let it happen, \Nthat's where everything ends!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.90,0:02:47.81,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.25,0:02:52.32,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I can't condone anything that hurts you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.14,0:02:57.87,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I can't forgive a world that hurts you \Nand tries to crush your dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.40,0:03:01.42,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I'll be the only wound you need,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.42,0:03:03.97,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,the scar that stops you from giving up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.58,0:03:08.16,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Even if you resent me or hate me,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.16,0:03:11.26,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I'll keep wishing for your \Nhappiness over and over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.57,0:03:16.64,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Miss Anis, I want you to be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.64,0:03:20.16,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Happier than anyone in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.05,0:03:28.84,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,That goes for me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.35,0:03:33.58,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Aerial Attack: Dragon Heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.03,0:03:40.73,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I won't just let you suffer!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.11,0:03:43.30,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,That's why I can't let you win!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.30,0:03:44.71,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I don't want to lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.99,0:03:50.30,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,If this is what it takes to \Nstop your tears, I won't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.25,0:03:53.38,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I'll accept all of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.00,0:03:59.29,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Gather and combine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.32,0:04:09.61,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Combine... and be!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.31,0:04:14.44,Default,Lumielle,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.79,0:04:18.72,Default,Lumielle,0,0,0,,It has been done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.03,0:04:21.24,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Miss Anis!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.64,0:04:26.16,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,This is the power within me \Nthat you showed to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.16,0:04:28.36,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,It's the future you dreamed of!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.36,0:04:31.22,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,No matter how many times you try to give up,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.22,0:04:32.57,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I will show it to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.08,0:04:41.71,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Arc-en-Ciel!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.42,0:05:22.68,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Miss Anis.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.79,0:05:31.90,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,That was... so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.66,0:05:38.55,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,There's no way I could beat that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.79,0:05:41.97,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Euphie...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.57,0:05:43.40,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.47,0:05:48.86,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,You're not fair. You're just not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.63,0:05:54.84,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Miss Anis, it was you \Nwho brought me this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.36,0:05:57.57,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I couldn't have made it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.05,0:06:02.73,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I couldn't have loved the world \Nthis much on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.30,0:06:08.55,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,The world only looks so beautiful \Nbecause you're in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.24,0:06:12.35,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,If you also think it's beautiful, \Nthen please...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.12,0:06:15.72,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,love yourself, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.49,0:06:23.33,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Euphie... I... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.85,0:06:24.93,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.61,0:06:28.06,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I'm not okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.06,0:06:30.67,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,There's no way I can be okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.45,0:06:41.05,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I will hold your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.77,0:06:43.89,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.18,0:06:49.41,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,You, and no one else.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.26,0:07:17.45,Default,Sylphine,0,0,0,,Anis, I—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.45,0:07:18.55,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.54,0:07:20.79,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.66,0:07:25.71,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I really don't think I can be queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.12,0:07:32.79,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I always knew you condemned yourself \Nbecause I can't use magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.51,0:07:37.05,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,so I thought I should at least take that \Noff your back by becoming queen...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.01,0:07:42.21,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,and that if I didn't, I couldn't call myself \Nthe daughter of you and Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.30,0:07:45.23,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for being a useless dau—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.64,0:07:52.35,Default,Sylphine,0,0,0,,How could you call yourself useless?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.35,0:07:56.63,Default,Sylphine,0,0,0,,You're a far better daughter \Nthan I could ever deserve!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.37,0:07:58.81,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.45,0:08:02.89,Default,Sylphine,0,0,0,,You've been trying so hard all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.89,0:08:06.53,Default,Sylphine,0,0,0,,But you don't have to try hard \Nby yourself anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.93,0:08:09.84,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Can I really stay as a princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.59,0:08:13.01,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,As your and Father's daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.00,0:08:44.19,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Euphie, are you still awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.12,0:08:46.66,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Miss Anis?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.66,0:08:50.63,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Oh... S-Sorry to bother you so late.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.71,0:08:54.59,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,No, I don't mind at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.59,0:09:06.58,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I wanted to say... sorry, \NI guess. And thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.52,0:09:18.56,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,There's a reason I was so \Nhung up on being queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.56,0:09:21.71,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,and being the daughter \Nof my mother and father.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.15,0:09:23.75,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,A reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.97,0:09:26.89,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I kept it a secret all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.44,0:09:31.10,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,A secret I never shared with anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.50,0:09:35.80,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Anyone? Not even Ilia or Tilty?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.39,0:09:37.11,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.88,0:09:40.91,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,You're the first person \NI ever thought of telling it to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.29,0:09:45.47,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I planned to take it with me to my grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.31,0:09:48.33,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Euphie...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.50,0:09:53.89,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Will you take this secret \Nto the grave with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.73,0:09:58.87,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Yes. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.08,0:10:05.61,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I have memories from a past life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.07,0:10:10.56,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I lived in a completely different world \Nfrom this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.56,0:10:14.09,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Magic only existed in fairy tales there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.38,0:10:18.50,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,When I saw that magic existed in this world,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.50,0:10:20.62,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I thought it seemed like a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.88,0:10:28.54,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Sometimes I wished it {\i1}was{\i0} a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.28,0:10:30.78,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Miss Anis?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.58,0:10:37.69,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Am I really Anisphia Wynn Palettia at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.87,0:10:44.37,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,On the inside, I'm not simply \N"Anisphia Wynn Palettia."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.63,0:10:52.09,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I wondered if my being reborn here \Nerased the original Anisphia—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.42,0:10:57.89,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,if I took their daughter away from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.31,0:11:03.52,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,When I thought of that... it scared me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.96,0:11:07.48,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I thought, I must be just a fake...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.22,0:11:13.94,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,There's no way you're just a fake!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.40,0:11:18.20,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,You're the one who reached out \Nyour hand to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.56,0:11:22.60,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,The one who pulled me from \Nthe depths of despair that day
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.60,0:11:24.47,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,was the you who's sitting here now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.30,0:11:28.32,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,It's right here, isn't it? \NEverything you felt,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.32,0:11:29.51,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,everything you wished for,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.03,0:11:31.73,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,everything you wanted... All of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.39,0:11:39.05,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,The you that you know, \Nand the you that cares about me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.05,0:11:41.07,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,is undeniably right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.88,0:11:44.29,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,So please don't call yourself a fake!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.68,0:11:50.92,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,To me, you are the greatest \Nmagician in the whole world!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.10,0:11:58.39,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.71,0:12:31.83,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Wh-Why did you kiss me?! You dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.83,0:12:33.68,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Because I wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.68,0:12:38.44,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,W-Wanted to?! You should only \Nkiss the person you love!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.72,0:12:40.90,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I do love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.72,0:12:47.40,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,B-But just, like, out of respect \Nand friendship, right?! It has to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.87,0:12:54.03,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,If it's what you want, I will offer you \Nmy loyalty and friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.63,0:13:05.25,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,But if you can, I'd like you to \Naccept this feeling for what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.25,0:13:07.47,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Euphie, wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.59,0:13:09.70,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I won't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.01,0:13:21.11,Default,Orphanse,0,0,0,,Euphyllia has completed the spirit contract
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.11,0:13:23.97,Default,Orphanse,0,0,0,,and been recognized as a member \Nof the royal family.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.29,0:13:30.04,Default,Orphanse,0,0,0,,The time is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.81,0:13:33.62,Default,Orphanse,0,0,0,,I am going to step down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.67,0:13:45.02,Default,Orphanse,0,0,0,,I entrust you to be the next ruler \Nof this kingdom, Euphyllia.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.02,0:13:46.54,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Yes, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.93,0:13:48.39,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.94,0:13:50.04,Default,Orphanse,0,0,0,,Anis...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.43,0:13:54.82,Default,Orphanse,0,0,0,,You are to support the queen \Nas her older sister from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.82,0:13:57.12,Default,Orphanse,0,0,0,,Accompany her in forging ahead to the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.60,0:13:59.22,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Yes, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.77,0:14:02.85,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,My future is with Euphie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.02,0:14:07.20,Default,Orphanse,0,0,0,,Now, what sort of ruler will you be,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.20,0:14:09.29,Default,Orphanse,0,0,0,,and how will you build up this kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.58,0:14:16.19,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I will bring a proper end \Nto the current age of magic
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.19,0:14:18.53,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,and the traditions we have \Nkept for generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.53,0:14:21.74,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,That is my purpose for becoming queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.05,0:14:25.10,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,And I will build an age in which \Nmagic is accessible to anyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.10,0:14:28.82,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,not just to the nobility \Nas their exclusive privilege.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.82,0:14:30.74,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,And the one to bring that age will be...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.40,0:14:33.48,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I want...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.24,0:14:37.17,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,If I must put it into words,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.17,0:14:39.27,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I want to expand freedom to all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.00,0:14:43.39,Default,Orphanse,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.65,0:14:45.97,Default,Orphanse,0,0,0,,I would love to see such a kingdom myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.69,0:14:49.19,Default,Orphanse,0,0,0,,I know the two of you can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.05,0:14:57.36,Default,Grantz,0,0,0,,Still, while it may be freedom, \Nit's difficult to picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.36,0:15:00.97,Default,Grantz,0,0,0,,A rift separates the way\Nnobles and commoners think.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.97,0:15:03.99,Default,Grantz,0,0,0,,Complete understanding \Nwill not come quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.99,0:15:05.10,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Regarding that...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.58,0:15:07.92,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I have a suggestion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.34,0:16:00.77,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,Okay, this is the last delivery.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.08,0:16:04.52,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,What? Was there still something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.30,0:16:09.70,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.12,0:16:12.20,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I requested it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.28,0:16:15.29,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,A magic sword just for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.29,0:16:15.86,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.40,0:16:22.28,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,What is its name?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.46,0:16:27.81,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,"Celestial."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.46,0:16:30.62,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,It means "of the skies."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.60,0:16:37.57,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Since my Arc-en-Ciel means "rainbow,"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.57,0:16:39.59,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I wanted a name close in meaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.03,0:16:46.46,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,A rainbow and the sky, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.46,0:16:48.07,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,You're right. They do match.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.07,0:16:53.48,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I think it's perfect for the first person \Nin the world to think about ways to fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.95,0:17:15.12,Default,Commoner,0,0,0,,They're flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.12,0:17:17.22,Default,Commoner,0,0,0,,People other than Miss Anis can fly now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.73,0:17:24.68,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Everyone, thank you very much \Nfor your generous applause.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.93,0:17:28.85,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Okay, the next thing I have \Nto show you is... this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.52,0:17:36.62,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,A dress and coat that give anyone \Nwearing them the ability to fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.00,0:17:41.87,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,We will now give a demonstration \Nof flight and aerial dancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.13,0:17:48.42,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,This is the new shape we wish \Nto give to this kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.82,0:17:54.39,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Endless potential, unbound by \Nestablished concepts and stereotypes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.68,0:17:55.84,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,That is freedom!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.11,0:18:04.33,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Hey, Euphie...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.54,0:18:07.25,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I'll live a long life, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.03,0:18:09.81,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.55,0:18:12.54,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I'll do something about \Nthe immortality, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.22,0:18:14.92,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I'll study my hardest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.92,0:18:17.94,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,If nothing else, I could always \Nbecome immortal, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.94,0:18:19.33,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I look forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.20,0:18:23.03,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,So stay with me forever, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.47,0:18:24.26,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.12,0:18:26.66,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Together forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.80,0:18:51.73,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Euphie...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.78,0:18:53.98,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.50,0:18:56.43,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Yes, Miss Anis!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.06,0:19:22.82,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.07,0:20:02.36,DefaultItalics,Lumielle,0,0,0,,The kingdom's history henceforth
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.39,0:20:06.11,DefaultItalics,Lumielle,0,0,0,,would record the name of the queen \Nwho entrusted the future
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.11,0:20:10.31,DefaultItalics,Lumielle,0,0,0,,to the next generation, \Nleading it from the old age to the new.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.29,0:20:14.27,DefaultItalics,Lumielle,0,0,0,,The queen who, in order to \Ncorrect warped traditions,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.27,0:20:17.63,DefaultItalics,Lumielle,0,0,0,,achieved the same great undertaking \Nas the founding king,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.63,0:20:21.27,DefaultItalics,Lumielle,0,0,0,,becoming the last noble queen \Nand the one to end tradition.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.66,0:20:25.68,DefaultItalics,Lumielle,0,0,0,,That queen's name was \NEuphyllia Fez Palettia.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.91,0:20:30.16,DefaultItalics,Lumielle,0,0,0,,And by the queen's side
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.16,0:20:33.56,DefaultItalics,Lumielle,0,0,0,,was the princess who carried \Nthe original royal family's blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.48,0:20:38.53,DefaultItalics,Lumielle,0,0,0,,An innovator who had been long \Npersecuted by tradition,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.53,0:20:40.88,DefaultItalics,Lumielle,0,0,0,,now the leader of the next generation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.78,0:20:44.80,DefaultItalics,Lumielle,0,0,0,,The princess who loved \Nmagic more than any other,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.80,0:20:47.69,DefaultItalics,Lumielle,0,0,0,,despite being shunned by \Nmagic more than any other.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.32,0:20:53.29,DefaultItalics,Lumielle,0,0,0,,That princess's name was \NAnisphia Wynn Palettia.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.38,0:20:58.20,DefaultItalics,Lumielle,0,0,0,,These two young ladies closed the gap \Nbetween tradition and revolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.71,0:21:03.78,DefaultItalics,Lumielle,0,0,0,,The people would relate the legend of their \Ngreat accomplishments for years to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.32,0:21:07.98,DefaultItalics,Lumielle,0,0,0,,But all of that is yet to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.28,0:21:13.67,DefaultItalics,Lumielle,0,0,0,,Their revolution, after all, \Nhas only just begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.99,0:21:16.28,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Place in the sky...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.70,0:21:17.90,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,...a rainbow!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.08,0:21:32.03,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Shower all those...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.03,0:21:33.69,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,...who reside in this kingdom...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.39,0:21:35.87,Default,Euphyllia/Anisphia,0,0,0,,...with blessings!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.02,0:21:54.58,Default,Lainie,0,0,0,,Really, Miss Anis! You slept much too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.58,0:21:56.16,Default,Lainie,0,0,0,,Your breakfast will get cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.16,0:21:58.59,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Oh... Sorry, Lainie.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.59,0:22:00.86,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Good morning, Miss Anis.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.86,0:22:02.13,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Morning, Euphie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.35,0:22:07.08,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,You don't need to call me "Miss" anymore, \Nbut you still do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.39,0:22:08.90,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,It's a habit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.90,0:22:11.55,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I'll be more careful from now on, Anis.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.51,0:22:15.37,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.57,0:22:19.93,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,You seem to have fully acclimated \Nto your role as a maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.52,0:22:24.01,Default,Lainie,0,0,0,,It's all thanks to Miss Ilia.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.01,0:22:26.62,Default,Ilia,0,0,0,,You learn very quickly, Lainie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.14,0:22:28.71,Default,Ilia,0,0,0,,You are an apprentice worth teaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.71,0:22:32.00,Default,Lainie,0,0,0,,O-Oh... Not at all...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.00,0:22:34.26,Default,Ilia,0,0,0,,You have truly been a great help.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.74,0:22:37.88,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Anis?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.21,0:22:42.07,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Nah, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.98,0:22:46.62,Default,Ilia,0,0,0,,Miss Anisphia, Miss Euphyllia,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.62,0:22:49.15,Default,Ilia,0,0,0,,you will be late if you don't leave soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.15,0:22:51.31,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Huh? It's already that late?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.31,0:22:54.43,Default,Lainie,0,0,0,,You take too long to eat, Miss Anis!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.30,0:22:58.85,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Oh, Euphie...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.60,0:23:05.48,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.47,0:23:15.03,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,When will you kiss me \Non the lips instead, I wonder?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.03,0:23:17.30,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I-I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.51,0:23:23.95,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Euphie!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.85,0:23:27.43,Default,Euphie,0,0,0,,We'll be late, Anis!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.18,0:23:39.93,Next Episode Title,Title,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,114)}Episode Twelve\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N{\fs25}Their Magical Revolution
